# DrumMania 3rd Mix (G*A23 VER. JAA): a game, from what drmn3m-install.his left (the flash
# installed; the game cassette in): the title is at frame ~4,000. Two coins, Start through the
# screens to the music select's default; the stage played on the pads: the snare every 8 frames,
# the hi-hat every 16, the bass drum every 12, a tom or the cymbal now and then. Hashes the main
# RAM every frame, snapshots every 60 frames, to compare with MAME.
game drmn3m

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

at 4900 press "Coin 1" 8
at 4940 press "Coin 1" 8
at 5100 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 5400 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 5700 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 6000 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 6300 press "1 Player Start" 8
from 6600 every 8 press "Snare" 4
from 6604 every 16 press "Hi-Hat" 4
from 6602 every 12 press "Bass Drum" 4
from 6610 every 48 press "High Tom" 4
from 6634 every 48 press "Low Tom" 4
from 6650 every 96 press "Cymbal" 4
from 0 every 60 snap
at 14000 quit
